WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:01.280
Young General Zu

00:01.360 --> 00:03.027
Since you have the inclination

00:03.280 --> 00:05.613
This humble one will show some skill

00:07.600 --> 00:09.000
Please

00:16.520 --> 00:17.920
Your Highness calling me "Young General Zu"

00:18.000 --> 00:19.400
Sounds very nice

00:19.600 --> 00:21.000
In the military camp

00:21.320 --> 00:23.653
I rarely hear people call me that

00:24.280 --> 00:25.947
What do they call you?

00:26.400 --> 00:27.800
Usually when we meet

00:27.880 --> 00:29.547
They call me "Young General"

00:29.680 --> 00:31.080
On the training ground

00:31.160 --> 00:32.600
They call me "Grandma"

